    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7582" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-σφάλλω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σφαλῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					17.6.5
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σφῆλαι</span>
			), intr., <i>rise from a fall</i> or <i>illness, recover,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμπτώματος ἀνασφῆλαι</span>”
