			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῆς νόσου</span>
				Nic.Dam.<i><span class="en">
				p.98D.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				75.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσου καὶ πόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					78.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				34.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Abd.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			: abs., J.l.c.</div>
